Recommends: tailscale
# Until 1.4.2 the server package was called ele-messenger; that name now
# belongs to the app every machine installs.
Replaces: ele-messenger (<< 1.4.2-1)
Breaks: ele-messenger (<< 1.4.2-1)
Description: ELE Messenger server: accounts, direct messages, groups and images
 The fuller ELE Messenger for a household network: PIN accounts, direct
 messages, groups, images and a web client, over the LAN and tailnet. The
 ELE Mesh (the ele-messenger package) keeps working when this server or the
 network is down.
